[38;5;246m  ⎿  · Which approach should the design use? → A + injection seam (Recommended)[39m
     [38;5;246m· How should the refresh gap be resolved (ID survives refresh, in-memory token does not)? → Clear ID if no token [39m
     [38;5;246m(Recommended)[39m
     [38;5;246m· How should the CommonJS/ESM split in package.json be handled? → Add type:module, rename to .cjs (Recommended)[39m

